  "description": "Get your new love through second-hand deals (?!)\n\nAfter breaking up with her boyfriend, Han-gyeol sold memories on the second-hand trading app 'Neighborhood Market'. However, she soon learns that the buyer is her ex-boyfriend... Embarrassed, Han-gyeol manages to escape the crisis with a 'second-hand boyfriend' who just appeared...! Ian, a new relationship with my ex-boyfriend Kanghyun, what is the ending of this love triangle...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=773524), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6412043)",
